    <item>
      <title>从“单次出图”到“精确交付”：GPT-Image-2.5的多轮编辑工作流</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260910/%E4%BB%8E%E5%8D%95%E6%AC%A1%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%B2%BE%E7%A1%AE%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98GPT-Image-2.5%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%9A%E8%BD%AE%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81/</link>
